                                                "sense_id": "bc424023-0ba5-3dce-aab4-42f274e4d84e",
                                                "text": "So I punched a hole in the roof, ah-ah, ah-ah\nLet the flood carry away all my pictures of you"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ed08fb09-c3d9-3287-a2de-89bbeed1b809",
